{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00627",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.21,
      "end_seconds": 12.71,
      "duration_seconds": 11.5,
      "text": "Well, here we are again, and I've got my good cardigan on, so that tells you how seriously I take you. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.56,
      "end_seconds": 18.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "I'm flattered, Doris. And who's this with you? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 20.63,
      "end_seconds": 28.6,
      "duration_seconds": 7.97,
      "text": "Beverley, Doctor. I'm her carer, I come in every morning and Tuesday and Thursday teatimes. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.34,
      "end_seconds": 39.68,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "Lovely. So, Doris, it's about six weeks since you broke your hip. How's the walking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.42,
      "end_seconds": 53.65,
      "duration_seconds": 11.23,
      "text": "Better than it was, though I'm not winning any races. My daughter says I'm a tortoise with a frame. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.62,
      "end_seconds": 65.58,
      "duration_seconds": 8.96,
      "text": "A tortoise that's getting about, that's the main thing. Any pain when you walk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.78,
      "end_seconds": 81.67,
      "duration_seconds": 13.89,
      "text": "It's not so much pain, it's more that my hip is stiff, first thing in the morning especially. It loosens up by the time I've had my toast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 83.62,
      "end_seconds": 93.99,
      "duration_seconds": 10.37,
      "text": "She's quicker after breakfast, that's right. And she's been doing her exercises with the physio sheet every day. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.97,
      "end_seconds": 99.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "That's grand. Any falls since you came home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.59,
      "end_seconds": 109.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.61,
      "text": "Not one. Bev won't let me, she hovers like a hawk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 111.78,
      "end_seconds": 117.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Not a single fall, Doctor, I'd have rung you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.3,
      "end_seconds": 133.81,
      "duration_seconds": 15.51,
      "text": "Good, that's what I wanted to hear. Let's go through the tablets, because I want to be sure they all match what I've got on screen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 135.9,
      "end_seconds": 148.02,
      "duration_seconds": 12.12,
      "text": "I put them out every morning in the little box. There's the amlodipine, 5 mg, once a day, for her blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.16,
      "end_seconds": 156.6,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "And the one for my bones. I can never remember what it's called."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 159.35,
      "end_seconds": 171.93,
      "duration_seconds": 12.58,
      "text": "Alendronic acid, 70 mg once a week. It's Sundays, because she has to take it on an empty stomach and sit up for half an hour."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.53,
      "end_seconds": 179.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Perfect, Sundays is a good routine. Anything for pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.75,
      "end_seconds": 190.56,
      "duration_seconds": 9.81,
      "text": "Only the paracetamol, 500 mg, when my hip's playing up. I don't like taking tablets for the sake of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.78,
      "end_seconds": 202.56,
      "duration_seconds": 9.78,
      "text": "That's the right way round. I notice you've got osteoporosis on your notes, and the high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.43,
      "end_seconds": 215.98,
      "duration_seconds": 10.55,
      "text": "That's me. Osteoporosis, they said, which is why the hip went when I only tripped on the cat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 217.29,
      "end_seconds": 221.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "That cat's a menace, Doctor. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.99,
      "end_seconds": 230.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.17,
      "text": "He is, but we'll keep him. Right, let's do your numbers. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.08,
      "end_seconds": 235.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Oh, I do love a numbers day. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.31,
      "end_seconds": 265.1,
      "duration_seconds": 8.79,
      "text": "Pulse 72, blood pressure 134 over 80, temperature 36.5, oxygen 97 percent, and you weigh 58 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.72,
      "end_seconds": 273.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Is that good or do I need feeding up? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.66,
      "end_seconds": 292.68,
      "duration_seconds": 16.02,
      "text": "It's steady, and it's the same as last time, so you're not losing weight. Since you've had the fracture, I'd like to arrange a bone density scan, to see how strong the bones are now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 295.64,
      "end_seconds": 302.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "Is that the one where you lie flat on a bed? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.0,
      "end_seconds": 310.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.22,
      "text": "That's it. Painless and quick. You don't need to do anything special for it. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.97,
      "end_seconds": 320.89,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "Will it tell me why I've got to take that Sunday tablet? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.94,
      "end_seconds": 331.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.56,
      "text": "It'll tell us whether the treatment is doing its job, and whether we need to change it. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.83,
      "end_seconds": 338.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "Right. Good. I like to know why I'm doing things. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.06,
      "end_seconds": 350.47,
      "duration_seconds": 9.41,
      "text": "And I'd like to see you again in three months, once the scan is done, to talk about the results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 351.78,
      "end_seconds": 359.5,
      "duration_seconds": 7.72,
      "text": "I'll book that, Doris. I'll put it in the diary by the fridge. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.28,
      "end_seconds": 365.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "Doctor, can I ask you something? About bingo. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.16,
      "end_seconds": 369.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Go on. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 372.42,
      "end_seconds": 380.15,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "Is it all right to go back on a Thursday if Bev drives me? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.26,
      "end_seconds": 389.58,
      "duration_seconds": 8.32,
      "text": "As long as you use the frame and don't rush, I don't see why not. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 390.52,
      "end_seconds": 393.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Marvellous. Thank you, love. ~"
    }
  ]
}
